{"4612650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Metro Anomaly", "steam_appid": 4612650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5084160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metro Anomaly is an anomaly-hunting horror game where you must identify the anomaly by its behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anomaly can be something as simple as an unnatural head turn or a twisted joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it can also be someone staring at you or even trying to attack you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANOMALY EXAMPLE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you’ve identified the anomaly, you can aim and shoot — but you only have one bullet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you’re wrong, the anomaly will attack you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOT EVERY ANOMALY WILL JUST WAIT FOR YOU TO FIND IT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metro Anomaly is an anomaly-hunting horror game where you must identify the anomaly by its behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anomaly can be something as simple as an unnatural head turn or a twisted joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it can also be someone staring at you or even trying to attack you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANOMALY EXAMPLE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/5e25d24250188630bfc3b4078d2011af.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you’ve identified the anomaly, you can aim and shoot — but you only have one bullet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you’re wrong, the anomaly will attack you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/262818eae6133042042c470d3690c26b.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOT EVERY ANOMALY WILL JUST WAIT FOR YOU TO FIND IT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.poster.avif?t=1786302835\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.webm?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612650/extras/8ac4355168c0ecd015f591793266b9b7.mp4?t=1786302835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Watch the behavior of the office clerks closely and find the one who is merely pretending to be human. You have only one bullet t